Skills pre-installed into every Hermes profile by docker/cont-init.d/04-vibe-city-skills (copied when missing).
Vendored so the container needs no network at start and agents get a reviewed, pinned copy. To update: re-copy
from the source and change the commit here. Which department enables which skill: packages/shared/src/templates/.
Hermes' own optional skills are listed in HERMES_OPTIONAL and copied from the image, not vendored.

